        "id": "i",
        "text": "Which claim is correct?",
        "marks": 1,
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "A solar eclipse occurs when the Moon comes between the Sun and Earth and blocks sunlight from a small area of Earth."
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "A solar eclipse occurs when Earth comes between the Sun and the Moon."
          },
          {
